A||||7||RossT||what cars do you mistake for a fiero from a distance?||||1||
Z||000000||RossT||02-03-2000||02:52 AM||||Like most of us, I scan the roads, when driving, for fieros. 9 times out of 10, when i think i see one, I am wrong.  Those dam Plymouth Lazers and Dodge Daytonas (shelby) get me every time.  Especially from a distance from the front.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Standard||02-03-2000||03:10 AM||||Yep, it's always those freakin' daytonas.  i hate that.  The 1st gen Ford Probes, too. always from the front, tho.  Nothing quite looks like a Fiero from the back..||||reg||1
Z||000002||Monkeyman||02-03-2000||03:36 AM||||I always mistake the old Cadillacs for a Fiero.  Of course, I'm legally blind in one eye and can't hear out of the other. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I don't make too many mistakes in that area.  I've been searching for them for 15 years.||||reg||1
Z||000003||fiero56||02-03-2000||09:00 AM||||Acura NSX every time. Really aggrivates me. I don't know why I mistake the front end of one for a Fiero, but everytime I pass one on the road I'm ready to wave until I catch a glimpse of the rest of the car and realize "oh, it's just an NSX". Fieros are kinda' rare around here.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Formula||02-03-2000||09:27 AM||||I once pointed out a "new" corvette to a friend because I just saw the hood and the "daytime" running lights.  It turned out to be a Fiero Coupe with driving lights on.  I was impressed.<P>I always mix up the front of the probes and Fiero coupes.  Never mistake a GT for anything though.  I can pick Formulas out fairly easy too because of the tires.  You can see the rear ones sticking out the side a little bit on the highway.||||reg||1
Z||000005||mshill||02-03-2000||01:42 PM||||Just this morning my son said there's a Fiero<BR>(about a block away).  When we got close it was a gen 2 RX-7.  From the back (and a long ways away) the 300ZX looks kinda like a Fiero GT. ||||reg||1
Z||000006||DISenchanted||02-03-2000||04:26 PM||||I would agree on the 300zx.  I have waved to so many of those around here.  The NSX looks very similar as well.  Would any of you be interested in an NSX front facia?  I really want to make one, but I'd need more interest.<P>DISenchanted||||reg||1
